references/bpc/VIS.md:73:**Conflict resolution:** TWSI colour (yellow/mid-yellow is the consensus standard) may conflict with dementia design requirements for plain, low-pattern flooring. Resolution: use detectable profile rather than relying on colour alone; yellow TWSI is acceptable where dementia colour provisions apply if profiling is the primary detection mechanism.
